00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Plenty of project information. But where do you really stand?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Over twelve months, Mantiva360 evolved alongside multiple projects. Each delivery challenge informed the next iteration.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
It began with financial tracking: bringing budgets, forecasts and actuals into view.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Invoice reconciliation added another layer of commercial control.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The plan on a page connected activities, dependencies and resources to the delivery picture.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Evidence-based earned value brought supporting evidence into the assurance of reported progress.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The 360 Cockpit brought attention, cause, action and impact together, helping teams focus on what matters.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Scenario modelling opened up alternatives, making resource and cost trade-offs easier to explore.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Change requests brought scope and resource decisions into a governed process.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Today, AI agents assist analysis. Calculation engines compute the controls. People remain accountable for decisions.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Integrated reporting carries that connected picture into the conversation. Less time reconstructing status. More time controlling delivery.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Mantiva360. Data to Progress. Let’s see it in action.
